OL,5,G0232 The Climate Question
OL,6,     FThe UN says we will pass our most
OL,7,     Fimportant climate target in the
OL,8,     Fnext few years. Is it possible to
OL,9,     Fbring the global temperature back
OL,10,     Fdown? And will the damage be
OL,11,     Firreversible?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FWhen 276 girls were seized in
OL,17,     FChibok, north-east Nigeria, Aisha
OL,18,     FYesufu felt it personally. She
OL,19,     Fcame from the same impoverished
OL,20,     Fbackground and knew she had to
OL,21,     Fgive them a voice.
